      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "This issue with the screen capture camera has been fixed in the latest release.\nHowever, we are aware of this same issue (flipped and zoomed in view) occurring with user-created cameras such as those on avatars and worlds. We are investigating the problem and will do our best to come up with a solution that does not break older content. However this canny is specifically about the screen capture camera, so for issues related to user-created cameras, please see this canny: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1156-can-no-longer-render-directly-to-desktop-while-in-vr",
      "viewerReactions": null
